  "exclusions": [
    "Vision and other multimodal input is not supported in this release of the integration; models that ship a vision or audio encoder (Qwen3.5 and later, Gemma 4) run text-only.",
    "Embedding, classification and reward models and the Responses API are not supported; only text-generation models are offered.",
    "Checkpoints that need model code from their own repository (trust_remote_code) are never loaded, and neither are bitsandbytes or GGUF checkpoints; GGUF models run on llama.cpp.",
    "A model runs on one GPU; tensor parallelism across several cards is not supported."
  ]
